@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy</PageTitle>

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>
    CardiTrack collects health and fitness data to enable anomaly alerts, daily health
    digests, and trend monitoring for the people in your care circle.
</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>
    With your permission, CardiTrack reads activity, heart-rate, and sleep data from
    connected health devices, along with the account details you provide during signup.
</p>

<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>
    Health and fitness data is used only to power the features you signed up for:
    detecting unusual patterns, sending daily digests, and showing longer-term trends.
    We never sell or share your family's health data.
</p>

<h2>Retention and control</h2>
<p>
    You can disconnect a device at any time, which stops further collection. Contact us
    to request deletion of previously collected data.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
    Questions about this policy? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:cloudoperations@codesistance.com">cloudoperations@codesistance.com</a>.
</p>
